# Measured off art/back.jpg (db_admin, plate 1, nothing lettered on
# it), as fractions of its width (728px): the shield between 0.51 and
# 0.90, centred on the width; the band from 1.291 (0.918 of the height),
# 0.116 tall, came back as unprinted tan board, lighter than the violet
# — a short band, so the strip is one row, the install command beside
# the name. No frame on the plate, so the screenshots start near the top
# of the face, two frames at the shots' own proportion (580x503).
